{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Preserve retryability when backoff is interrupted.** Executor cancellation or an earlier `ClosedByInterruptException` can interrupt this sleep. Converting it to plain `PayloadOffloadException` makes the durable execution terminally fail instead of retrying the invocation. Keep the interrupt flag, but throw `RetryablePayloadOffloadException` and add an interrupted-sleeper test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7orDdd","finding_digest":"a830611def7ab542ddb3ffd823137570db6902564b9fbaf7a8502b7052ec4ae8","finding_id":"arf_v1_vaygchpppk2ufxnt77mcge3vod","finding_key":"sdk/offload/payloadoffloadretryexecutor::waitforretry::interrupt-retry-classification","identity_key":"sdk/offload/payloadoffloadretryexecutor::waitforretry::interrupt-retry-classification","line":76,"observation_digest":"9e5c7d196ae634f51b66e4d8bc16869581903379843510a5ff32514c716b5a8e","observation_id":"aro_v1_tzoh2glk4y2pkg3g4tmlyfugsw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/PayloadOffloadRetryExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:24:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_abor7bd26fs7iy3tburwxzwhjg","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"86d113eb900d5e847f2e29081d180b322c12b54a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":76,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_wozlv4572ikpf2zj6s7nys53yh"},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_j7ude3khi5gdkadmfqlk7ewmld","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:24:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
